WEBVTT

00:14.898 --> 00:18.781
We'll close the door and lock the world outside

00:18.801 --> 00:28.528
There's nowhere left that we need to hide The

00:28.609 --> 00:34.653
stage is empty and the lights are down We're the

00:34.753 --> 00:39.517
only two people left in this town

00:54.135 --> 00:58.477
The silence is loud but it feels so sweet No more

00:58.557 --> 01:01.918
running, no more defeat Just the sound of you

01:01.978 --> 01:06.360
breathing right next to me This is exactly where

01:06.400 --> 01:14.123
we're supposed to be It's just us in the end My

01:14.223 --> 01:17.705
savior, my shadow, my only

01:21.368 --> 01:28.535
Music stops and the curtains fall We're the only

01:28.615 --> 01:36.964
thing that matters at all Just you and me

01:41.288 --> 01:43.210
Like it's always gonna be

02:10.033 --> 02:17.198
I'll keep you safe When the shadows creep I'll

02:17.278 --> 02:23.783
hold your hand while you fall asleep We don't

02:23.803 --> 02:30.868
need the money We don't need the fame As long as

02:30.948 --> 02:35.471
you're here To whisper my name

02:38.213 --> 02:39.114
It's just us

02:43.742 --> 02:50.785
My savior, my shadow, my only true friend When

02:50.805 --> 02:57.888
the music stops and the curtains fall We're the

02:58.108 --> 03:06.832
only thing that matters at all Just you and me

03:11.234 --> 03:13.195
Like it's always gonna be

03:16.010 --> 03:21.100
Just us

03:23.084 --> 03:24.767
Just us

